<title>JAPAN: Japan's NEC denies reports of interest in Olivetti.</title>
<headline>Japan's NEC denies reports of interest in Olivetti.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>NEC Corp on Wednesday denied Italian press reports that it could be interested in buying Olivetti's personal computer business.</p>
<p>Shares in Olivetti rose over three percent in thin early trade on the Milan stock exchange on Wednesday on the reports of possible interest in the troubled high-tech group's PC business from Japanese electronics giants NEC and Sony Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;We have neither such interest nor plans,&quot; said an NEC spokesman when asked about the reports.  </p>
<p>A Sony spokesman, meanwhile, termed the Italian media reports &quot;groundless&quot;, saying there was no truth in them.</p>
</text>
